english:
Scoring 8 Weapon Hits within 5 seconds of each while Unstable Essence is active starts Critical Health Regeneration and restores 20 HP. Hits count up to once every 0.45 seconds.

2 second cooldown after healing triggers before additional Weapon Hits are counted.

// The source states 3.6s initially and 5.6s on subsequent activations with continuous hits, but the owner identified incorrect numbers; corrected timings are unverified.
